  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n4(1)/(10) - [2(1)/(2) - {(5)/(6) - ((2)/(5) + (3)/(10))}] \n\n**Concept used:**\n\nBODMAS:\n\n [IMAGE: https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/vUaBr3tL60KzuuO9oMfKO-Skgye0zl5jfd3laYfkuLhd_NG7bYa31x4-8pN3NqN2IMinwHRNuwUbQpLmm6FL2-yvs19LnIBzeVWcitqzx2GUb9ZMv8Tj5GzuRR_4uKTlmCvfRTlV3TKHzuTV] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n(41)/(10) - [(5)/(2) - {(5)/(6) - ((2)/(5) + (3)/(10))}] \n\n⇒ (41)/(10) - [(5)/(2) - {(5)/(6) - ((4 + 3)/(10))}] \n\n⇒ (41)/(10) - [(5)/(2) - ((5)/(6) - (7)/(10))]\n\n⇒ (41)/(10) - [(5)/(2) - {(25 - 21)/(30)}]\n\n⇒ (41)/(10) - [(5)/(2) - (4)/(30)]\n\n⇒ (41)/(10) - ([75 - 4])/(30)\n\n⇒ (41)/(10) - (71)/(30) \n\n⇒ ((123 - 71))/(30) = (52)/(30) = (26)/(15)\n\n**∴ The value of given equation is (26)/(15).**",
